1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:08,925
{\an8}Start from a ready-made theme: Midnight, Sand, Carbon, Classic, Aurora, Ember, Glacier and more.

2
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:14,675
{\an8}Auto day and night switches the theme at sunrise and sunset.

3
00:00:15,025 --> 00:00:17,725
{\an8}Color sets the base colour of the dash.

4
00:00:18,525 --> 00:00:22,550
{\an8}These settings are shared by the main dash and every sub dash.

5
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:26,925
{\an8}Background can be a solid colour, a gradient, or a photo.

6
00:00:27,475 --> 00:00:31,500
{\an8}In Cards, set the shape of the cards and their corner radius.

7
00:00:34,375 --> 00:00:39,375
{\an8}Spacing sets the gap between cards, the outer margin and the inner padding.

8
00:00:40,725 --> 00:00:46,300
{\an8}Under Text and labels, Card titles shows or hides the small captions, like SPEED.

9
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:50,875
{\an8}Click Use the theme's style to put the theme's settings back.

10
00:00:52,925 --> 00:00:57,050
{\an8}Pick a shape, like Soft or Cut, then drag Corner radius.

11
00:00:59,725 --> 00:01:02,475
{\an8}Sharp or round corners: it's your call.
